# golden eval runs (docs/eval/GOLDEN_EVALS_SPEC.md 6.1): per-case sandboxes/logs and the bundle copy stay local;
# run.json, cases/<id>.json, traces/ and summaries are small enough to commit
eval/golden/runs/*/cases/*/
eval/golden/runs/*/bundle/
# earlier attempts of re-run cases (--resume keeps their logs and spend) and locally built ablation arms
eval/golden/runs/*/attempts/*/
eval/golden/arms/
# data, collected trajectories, run logs and per-task outputs stay out of git (published separately)
data/graphs
data/embeddings
data/pallets/oracle/
